  /// <summary>
  /// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  /// ServiceAccountTenantMembership — an admin of a TARGET tenant lets a service
  /// account that lives in another (home) tenant act in the target tenant. The
  /// service account keeps exactly one typed grant in its home tenant; a
  /// membership adds no grant. Instead the account exchanges its home bearer for
  /// a short-lived target-tenant token (ExchangeServiceTokenForTenant) whose
  /// scopes are bounded by `approved_scopes_json`. Every such token is pinned to
  /// `membership_id` and `revision` and re-validated on every use, so revoking
  /// the membership, revoking the home grant or deactivating the account kills
